[ar:Joji]
[ti:Glimpse of Us]
[by:netease]
[00:00.00]作曲 : Castle/George Miller/Connor McDonough/Riley McDonough/Alexis Kesselman
[00:01.00]作词 : Connor McDonough/Alexis Kesselman/Castle/Riley McDonough/George Miller
[00:16.96]She’d take the world off my shoulders
[00:16.96]她会卸下我肩上重负
[00:20.98]If it was ever hard to move
[00:20.98]若难以迁移
[00:25.67]She’d turn the rain to a rainbow
[00:25.67]她会将落雨化作彩虹
[00:29.19]When I was living in the blue
[00:29.19]以排解我的忧郁
[00:34.16]Why then if she is so perfect
[00:34.16]若她果真那般完美 又是为何
[00:37.19]Do I still wish that it was you
[00:37.19]我仍然希望 身旁的人是你
[00:42.49]Perfect don’t mean that it’s working
[00:42.49]完美不意味着可以走下去
[00:45.36]So what can I do
[00:45.36]而我能做些什么
[00:50.21]When you’re out of sight
[00:50.21]你不在我眼前
[00:55.16]In my mind
[00:55.16]却在我心头
[00:58.73]Cause sometimes
[00:58.73]只因有时
[01:00.03]I look in her eyes and
[01:00.03]当我注视她的双眼
[01:02.75]That’s where I find
[01:02.75]你我的过往
[01:04.44]A glimpse of us
[01:04.44]悄然间浮现
[01:07.10]And I try
[01:07.10]我试着
[01:08.64]To fall for her touch
[01:08.64]爱上她的轻抚
[01:11.00]But I’m thinking of
[01:11.00]心里却在怀念着
[01:12.83]The way it was
[01:12.83]曾经的美好
[01:15.62]Said I’m fine
[01:15.62]说着我很好
[01:17.05]And said I moved on
[01:17.05]说着我已经释怀
[01:19.45]I’m only here passing time in her arms
[01:19.45]在她怀里的我 不过是虚度光阴
[01:23.86]Hoping I’ll find
[01:23.86]希望我能寻到
[01:26.58]A glimpse of us
[01:26.58]我们的曾经
[01:33.46]Tell me he savors your glory
[01:33.46]告诉我 他会欣赏你的风采
[01:37.13]Does he laugh the way I did
[01:37.13]他笑的方式 和我一样吗
[01:41.92]Is this a part of your story
[01:41.92]这是你故事的一部分吗
[01:45.23]One that I had never lived
[01:45.23]我从未体验过的生活
[01:50.35]Maybe one day you’ll feel lonely
[01:50.35]也许有朝一日 你也会深感寂寞
[01:53.61]And in his eyes you’ll get a glimpse
